  "body": "Did you say SUNNY? Then you'll want to see this one.\r\n\r\nElevated to capture beautiful sea views and filled with natural light, this warm and welcoming freehold family home offers the space, flexibility and easy indoor-outdoor living families are looking for.\r\n\r\nWith four generous bedrooms, two bathrooms plus a guest toilet, there's plenty of room for everyone to spread out, while the excellent connection between the living spaces and outdoors makes everyday living and entertaining effortless. Open the doors, let the sunshine in and enjoy a home that feels comfortable, practical and wonderfully easy to live in.\r\n\r\nProperty highlights:\r\n- Elevated position with beautiful sea views\r\n- Sunny, light-filled interiors\r\n- Freehold family home\r\n- Four generous bedrooms\r\n- Two bathrooms and guest toilet\r\n- Excellent indoor-outdoor flow\r\n- Garden and outdoor spaces for the whole family\r\n- Sought-after school zones including Rangitoto College\r\n- Walk to the beach, local shops and nearby parks\r\n\r\nAnd then there's the location. With the beach, shops and parks all within easy reach, plus excellent schooling nearby, this is a home that makes family life that little bit easier.\r\n\r\nWhether it's morning coffees in the sunshine, children enjoying the garden, relaxed family dinners or weekends at the beach, this is a home designed around the way families really live.\r\n\r\nOur sellers are ready for their next chapter, and now it's time for this much-loved home to welcome its next family.\r\n\r\nCome and see it for yourself - you may just know when you walk through the door.",
